/**************************************************************************
 *
 * PROJECT:	Icon Editor	(GOC Version)
 * FILE:	otherContent.goc
 *
 *		This project is inspired by the Icon Editor by Steve Yegge, 1992 - 1994
 *
 *
 * REVISION HISTORY:
 *	Name	Date		Description
 *	----	----		-----------
 *	RainerB 8/03/2025	Initial revision
 *
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:	Implementation of OtherContentClass
 *		OtherContentClass is used for different purposes to display
 *		more or less simple things. The Idea is to avoid a lot of
 *		VisContent subclasses.
 *		The content to be displayed is determined by the OCI_type
 *		instance variable.
 *
 **************************************************************************/


